<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 35-day T-bills sell at average 10.757 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 35-day T-bills sell at average 10.757 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian treasury bill sales at weekly auction last Friday as announced by the Central Bank on Wednesday:</p>
<p>    AUCTION DATE			9th May	2nd May</p>
<p>    TENOR				 35 days	35 days</p>
<p>    AMOUNT SOLD (million naira)   1,000	  900</p>
<p>    BIDS (million naira)	    1,250	  1,000</p>
<p>    WEIGHTED AVERAGE RATE	   10,7576 pct  9.7900 pct</p>
<p>    TRUE YIELD			  10,8114 pct  9.9435 pct</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
